{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.open","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":0,"board":{"board_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice","base_revision":0,"region_intent":"new_topic","region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"},"lesson":{"mode":"explain","language":"zh-CN","title":"偏导数：固定输入，求截线斜率","goals":["理解求对x的偏导数时需保持变量y固定为常数y₀","认识三维曲面在y=y₀截面上的交线是一元函数曲线z=g(x)","明确偏导数几何意义是截线在特定点处的切线斜率"],"adaptation":{"strategies":["承接上一课固定z等高线的思路，通过固定y引入垂直截面","通过3D曲面截线与2D平面截线切线对照，建立直观到代数的联系","借反例说明偏导数是否依赖y₀与函数具体形式相关"]},"variables":[{"as":"number_01","initial":0,"min":0,"max":2,"label":"截面位置y₀","control":{"kind":"slider","step":0.01}}],"tasks":[{"as":"section-03-task-01","prompt":"对于曲面 z = x² + y²，当固定 x = 1 时，截线方程为 z = 1 + y²。请将截面位置 y₀ 调节至目标值，使得截线上的高度 z 正好等于 2。","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"},"hints":["利用方程 2 = 1 + y₀² 进行计算","移项可得 y₀² = 1","题目要求非负的 y₀ 值"],"hint_after_attempts":2,"success_message":"回答正确！当 x=1、y₀=1 时，高度 z = 1² + 1² = 2。","allowed_operations":[{"kind":"variable_change","variable":"number_01","controls":["slider"]}],"completion":{"kind":"expression_target","expression":"number_01","value":1,"tolerance":0.005},"start":{"kind":"practice","variables":["number_01"],"values":{"number_01":0}}}],"reflections":[{"as":"section-04-reflection-01","prompt":"在点 P(1,1,2) 处求 ∂z/∂y，应该固定哪一个变量？","answer":"应固定 x = 1，沿 y 方向截取曲面，得到截线 z = 1 + y²；它在 y = 1 处的切线斜率就是 ∂z/∂y = 2y = 2。","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-02-item-01","availability":{"kind":"after_lesson"}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":1,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-01","purpose":"建立固定y=y₀的垂直截面几何模型与概念引入","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-01:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"上一课我们固定高度z研究了等高线。今天我们要研究对x的偏导数，方法是保持另一个输入变量y固定不变，设y等于常数y₀。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:1:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"z = f(x, y) = x^2 + y^2 \\quad (y = y_0)"},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}}],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-01:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"请看三维函数曲面图，我们建立曲面z等于x平方加y平方。同时插入一面垂直于y轴的截面，当前截面位置y₀设为0。","delivery":"neutral"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:1:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","kind":"scene3d","role":"main_visual","content":{"title":"曲面与垂直截面 (y=y₀)","fallback":"函数曲面 z=x^2 + y^2 与可变截面。","axes":true,"camera":{"yaw":0.72,"pitch":0.55,"zoom":1},"objects":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface","kind":"surface","label":"z=x^2 + y^2","color":"teal","expression":"x^2 + y^2","x_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"y_range":{"min":-2,"max":2},"samples":12}],"sections":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:section","axis":"y","value":0,"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:surface"],"display":"plane_and_intersection","label":"截面","color":"orange"}],"bindings":[{"target":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01:fragment:section.value","expression":"number_01"}]},"placement":{"relation":"new_region","region_role":"section-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:1:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"观察垂直截面与曲面的交线"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-01:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"在这个截面上，y始终保持为0不能改变，而x可以在截面内自由变化，高度z则随着x的变化而变化。这就是研究对x偏导数的几何框架。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:1:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-03-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"截面约束条件","items":["输入变量 y 固定为常数 y₀","输入变量 x 可自由变化","输出高度 z 仅随 x 变化：z = g(x)"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}}]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":2,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-02","purpose":"平移截面至y₀=1并绘制截线与2D切线对照图表","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"现在我把截面位置 y₀ 从 0 平移到 1。请注意，平移截面只是在选择我们要研究哪一条截线，平移本身并不是对 x 求导。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:2:1:1","op":"lesson.variable.animate","animation":{"variable":"number_01","to":1,"easing":"linear","duration_intent":"normal"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"当固定 y 等于 1 时，代入原曲面得到一元截线方程 g(x) 等于 x 平方加 1。若取 x₀ 等于 1，则对应空间点 P 为 (1, 1, 2)。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:2:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"y_0=1 \\implies z=g(x)=x^2+1, \\quad P=(1,1,2)"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:2:2:2","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-02","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"g'(1)=\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(1,1)}=2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}}]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-02:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"我们建立二维平面函数图，其中横轴表示 x，纵轴表示高度 z。图中标注了截线与在点 P 处斜率为 2 的切线，可以看到切线与抛物线精准相切。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:2:3:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01","kind":"plot","role":"supporting_visual","content":{"title":"y₀=1 截面截线与切线图 (纵轴表示高度z)","axes":{"x":{"min":-4,"max":4,"label":"x"},"y":{"min":-15,"max":20,"label":"z"}},"curves":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01:fragment:primary-curve","expression":"((x)^(2))+(1)","label":"截线 z=x²+1"},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01:fragment:curve-02","expression":"(2)*(x)","label":"P处切线 z=2x"}]},"placement":{"relation":"right_of","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-02-item-02"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}}],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:2:3:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"比较截线与切线在点P(1,2)的相切关系"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":3,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-03","purpose":"推导切线方程与偏导数公式，揭示几何斜率本质与边界","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"我们对截线函数求导。截线的高度等于 x 的平方加一，所以它的导数等于二乘以 x。在 x 等于一的位置，导数值就是二。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:3:1:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01","kind":"math","role":"derivation","content":{"latex":"g'(x) = 2x \\implies g'(1) = 2"},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:3:1:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"关注截线函数在x=1处的求导结果"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"切点的横坐标是一，高度是二，切线斜率也是二。根据点斜式，高度 z 减二，等于二乘以 x 减一，整理得到 z 等于二乘以 x。这里的斜率二，表示高度增量与 x 增量的极限比值，不是用量角器在屏幕上量出的角度。","delivery":"emphatic"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:3:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"截线切线与偏导数","items":["切点: (1, 2)","点斜式: z - 2 = 2(x - 1) => z = 2x","斜率本质: 瞬时变化率 lim(Δx→0) Δz/Δx，非视觉角度","一般偏导公式: f_x(x₀, y₀) = 2x₀"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-01-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}},{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:3:2:2","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-03:beat:moment-03","narration":{"text":"推广到一般位置，函数 x 的平方加 y 的平方，对 x 的偏导数等于二乘以 x。因此，在指定点处，偏导数等于该点 x 坐标的两倍。这里的结果与 y 坐标无关，是因为固定 y 时，y 的平方是常数，对 x 求导为零。这并不适用于所有曲面。例如函数 x 乘以 y，对 x 的偏导数等于 y，就依赖于 y 的取值。","delivery":"careful"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:3:3:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"],"intent":"明确偏导数的几何意义与结论适用边界"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.step","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":4,"step":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-04","purpose":"总结固定变量法并完成反求y₀的理解检测与课后应用","beats":[{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-01","narration":{"text":"总结一下：当我们需要求多元函数对 x 的偏导数时，关键是固定变量 y 等于常数 y₀。此时曲面在截面上的交线变成了关于 x 的一元函数，截线上选定点处的切线斜率就是偏导数。","delivery":"patient"},"stage":{"before_speech":[],"during_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:4:1:1","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"总结固定y求对x偏导数的本质"}}],"after_speech":[]}},{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:step:section-04:beat:moment-02","narration":{"text":"请思考便签上的问题：如果我们要在点 P(1,1,2) 处求函数对 y 的偏导数，应该固定哪一个变量？先自己想一想，课后可以展开思考题卡片核对答案。现在请完成课后练习。","delivery":"encouraging"},"stage":{"before_speech":[{"action_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:action:4:2:1","op":"board.create","node":{"id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-04-moment-02-item-01","kind":"note","role":"explanation","content":{"title":"固定变量法总结与思考","items":["求 ∂z/∂x：固定 y = y₀，研究 z 关于 x 的截线切线斜率","思考：在 P(1,1,2) 求 ∂z/∂y，应固定哪个变量？"]},"placement":{"relation":"below","anchor":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"},"region_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8-region"}}],"during_speech":[],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"本课程讲解了在多元函数z=f(x,y)中，固定y=y₀可得到平行于xz平面的垂直截面与交线z=g(x)。偏导数∂f/∂x即该截线上对应点的切线斜率。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-01-moment-02-item-01","surface-partial-derivative-slice-0.2.8:node:section-02-moment-03-item-01"]}}
